category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libxml2-devel
sdesc: "Open PDU smpp packaging and unpackaging tool (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This work is directed to C programmers with basic knowledge in SMPP protocol,
at least in the specification and handling of sessions. Extending the
development of the library, the scope of the same might involve a development
of protocols on TCP/IP."
